TEXT -280 416 Left 5 ;In this example there are 2x 400MW Generators present.\nThe loadsteps are at 4s 6s and 11s with each 100MW\nSince gen2 has constant torque (zero) the loadsteps are taken only by gen1\ngen2 torque is increased according P=100MW at t=10s \nTherefore gen1 is unburdend by 100MW. At t=11s the loadstep 3 with 100MW\n(see above) is taken by gen1 and from t=15.5s till t=18s the active power\noutput of gen2 is increased to 120MW. Stator voltage of gen2 is controlled \nby AVR whereas the voltage level of gen1 is set manually.
